  [
    "Are free courses enough?",
    "Often for starting. Compare with a paid option later."
  ],
  [
    "Which route is best?",
    "It depends on interest and local demand."
  ],
  [
    "Do I need coding?",
    "Not always. Basic spreadsheet skill helps."
  ],
  [
    "Can I start a business?",
    "Within the rules of your registration. Verify them."
